<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>RAG 流程图</title>
<style>
  * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }
  body {
    background: #0f172a;
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    align-items: center;
    min-height: 100vh;
    font-family: 'PingFang SC', 'Microsoft YaHei', sans-serif;
  }
  .container {
    width: 900px;
    padding: 40px;
  }
  h1 {
    text-align: center;
    color: #e2e8f0;
    font-size: 28px;
    margin-bottom: 40px;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 2px;
  }
  h1 span { color: #38bdf8; }

  .pipeline {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 0;
    flex-wrap: nowrap;
  }

  .step {
    width: 180px;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1e293b 0%, #0f172a 100%);
    border: 1.5px solid #334155;
    border-radius: 16px;
    padding: 22px 16px;
    text-align: center;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }
  .step-num {
    display: inline-block;
    width: 32px; height: 32px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #38bdf8, #818cf8);
    color: #fff;
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 16px;
    line-height: 32px;
    margin-bottom: 10px;
  }
  .step-icon { font-size: 28px; margin-bottom: 6px; }
  .step h3 { color: #f1f5f9; font-size: 14px; margin-bottom: 6px; }
  .step p { color: #94a3b8; font-size: 11px; line-height: 1.6; }
  .step code {
    display: inline-block;
    background: #334155;
    color: #38bdf8;
    padding: 2px 8px;
    border-radius: 4px;
    font-size: 11px;
    margin-top: 4px;
  }

  .arrow {
    color: #64748b;
    font-size: 32px;
    flex-shrink: 0;
    margin: 0 -4px;
    z-index: 1;
  }

  .detail-box {
    margin-top: 44px;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1e293b 0%, #0f172a 100%);
    border: 1.5px solid #334155;
    border-radius: 16px;
    padding: 28px 32px;
    display: flex;
    gap: 40px;
  }
  .detail-left {
    flex: 1;
  }
  .detail-right {
    flex: 1;
  }
  .detail-box h4 {
    color: #38bdf8;
    font-size: 13px;
    margin-bottom: 14px;
    letter-spacing: 1px;
  }
  .detail-box ul {
    list-style: none;
    color: #cbd5e1;
    font-size: 13px;
    line-height: 2.2;
  }
  .detail-box ul li::before {
    content: "▸ ";
    color: #818cf8;
  }
  .highlight {
    background: rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.12);
    border-left: 3px solid #38bdf8;
    padding: 6px 12px;
    border-radius: 0 6px 6px 0;
    margin-top: 10px;
    color: #e2e8f0;
    font-size: 12px;
  }
  .footer {
    text-align: center;
    color: #475569;
    font-size: 11px;
    margin-top: 36px;
  }

  /* ---- 第二张图: overlap 对比 ---- */
  .overlap-demo {
    display: flex;
    gap: 24px;
    margin-top: 0;
  }
  .bad-box, .good-box {
    flex: 1;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1e293b 0%, #0f172a 100%);
    border: 1.5px solid #334155;
    border-radius: 16px;
    padding: 20px;
  }
  .bad-box h3 { color: #f87171; font-size: 15px; margin-bottom: 14px; text-align: center; }
  .good-box h3 { color: #4ade80; font-size: 15px; margin-bottom: 14px; text-align: center; }
  .chunk {
    background: #1e293b;
    border: 1px solid #475569;
    border-radius: 8px;
    padding: 10px 12px;
    margin-bottom: 8px;
    font-size: 11px;
    color: #cbd5e1;
    line-height: 1.7;
    position: relative;
    word-break: break-all;
  }
  .chunk .label {
    font-size: 9px;
    color: #64748b;
    margin-bottom: 4px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 1px;
  }
  .highlight-orange {
    background: rgba(251, 146, 60, 0.25);
    padding: 1px 3px;
    border-radius: 2px;
    color: #fdba74;
  }
  .highlight-blue {
    background: rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.25);
    padding: 1px 3px;
    border-radius: 2px;
    color: #7dd3fc;
  }
  .highlight-green {
    background: rgba(74, 222, 128, 0.2);
    padding: 1px 3px;
    border-radius: 2px;
    color: #86efac;
  }
  .broken-line {
    border: none;
    border-top: 1px dashed #f87171;
    margin: 2px 0 6px;
  }
  .arrow-bad {
    text-align: center;
    color: #f87171;
    font-size: 13px;
    margin: 4px 0;
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<!-- ====== 图1: RAG 流程图 ====== -->
<div class="container" style="page-break-after: always;">
  <h1>🔍 <span>RAG</span> 检索增强生成 · 四步流水线</h1>

  <div class="pipeline">
    <!-- Step 1 -->
    <div class="step">
      <div class="step-num">①</div>
      <div class="step-icon">📄</div>
      <h3>文档加载</h3>
      <p>读入 PDF / TXT<br>LangChain 统一接口</p>
      <code>PyPDFLoader</code>
    </div>

    <div class="arrow">→</div>

    <!-- Step 2 -->
    <div class="step">
      <div class="step-num">②</div>
      <div class="step-icon">✂️</div>
      <h3>文本分割</h3>
      <p>切成长 800 字的小块<br>块间 100 字重叠</p>
      <code>overlap=100</code>
    </div>

    <div class="arrow">→</div>

    <!-- Step 3 -->
    <div class="step">
      <div class="step-num">③</div>
      <div class="step-icon">🧮</div>
      <h3>向量化存储</h3>
      <p>文字→384维向量<br>存入 Chroma 数据库</p>
      <code>all-MiniLM-L6-v2</code>
    </div>

    <div class="arrow">→</div>

    <!-- Step 4 -->
    <div class="step">
      <div class="step-num">④</div>
      <div class="step-icon">💬</div>
      <h3>检索 + 生成</h3>
      <p>搜 Top-4 相关块<br>连问题发给 LLM</p>
      <code>k=4</code>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="detail-box">
    <div class="detail-left">
      <h4>🛠 实际技术选型</h4>
      <ul>
        <li>聊天模型：DeepSeek（deepseek-chat）</li>
        <li>Embedding：HuggingFace 本地模型（免费）</li>
        <li>向量数据库：Chroma（轻量本地运行）</li>
        <li>框架：LangChain（组件拼装）</li>
      </ul>
      <div class="highlight">
        DeepSeek 接口兼容 OpenAI 格式 → <code>ChatOpenAI</code> 改个 <code>base_url</code> 就能"借壳"调用
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="detail-right">
      <h4>💡 面试能聊的 5 个点</h4>
      <ul>
        <li>四步流水线为什么这样设计</li>
        <li>chunk_size=800, overlap=100 怎么选的</li>
        <li>Embedding 用 API vs 本地模型的取舍</li>
        <li>向量数据库为什么能搜"意思相近"</li>
        <li>DeepSeek 借壳 OpenAI 接口格式</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="footer">Week 2 · RAG 实战打卡 | GitHub: 2390254083-lang</div>
</div>

</body>
</html>
